        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩkwĩthĩwa kwĩ syĩndũ nyingĩ ila singĩvasya maũndũ ma mana, mũndũ ũunĩkĩte na kyaũ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nũndũ nũũ ũla wĩsĩ ũla ũseo kwa mũndũ thayũnĩ wake, mĩthenya yonthe ya thayũ wake wa mana ũla wanangaa ta muunyĩ? Nũndũ nũũ ũla ũtonya kũtavya mũndũ ũndũ ũkethĩwa ĩtina wake ĩtheo wa syũa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
